      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1299181882,
      "text": "Stipagrostis obtusa is a perennial grass belonging to the grass family (Poaceae). It is a widespread species, being native to North Africa, Mauritania, Chad, Ethiopia, Southern Africa, Western Asia, the Arabian Peninsula and Pakistan."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Stipagrostis obtusa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stipagrostis_obtusa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 177856260,
      "text": "Stipagrostis obtusa est une espèce de plantes monocotylédones de la famille des Poaceae, sous-famille des Aristidoideae, originaire d'Afrique et d'Asie.\nCe sont des plantes herbacées vivaces, cespiteuses, aux tiges pouvant atteindre 60 cm de long, et aux inflorescences en panicules."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Stipagrostis obtusa",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stipagrostis_obtusa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29430257,
      "text": "Stipagrostis obtusa adalah rumput perenial yang termasuk dalam keluarga rumput-rumputan (Poaceae). Spesies ini tersebar luas dan merupakan tumbuhan asli Afrika Utara, Mauritania, Chad, Etiopia, Afrika Bagian Selatan, Asia Barat, Semenanjung Arab, dan Pakistan."
    }
